# [[.PROJECT_NAME]]

[[.DESCRIPTION]]

A Spigot plugin for Minecraft [[.MC_VERSION]], written in Go and compiled to JVM bytecode with
[gojvm](https://github.com/AydenC77/gojvm).

    gojvm build            # -> build/[[.PLUGIN_NAME]].jar
    gojvm check            # compile only

Copy the jar into your server's `plugins/` folder. Main class: `[[.MAIN_CLASS]]`.

* `plugin.go`   – the main class (extends `JavaPlugin`)
* `listener.go` – an event listener (`@EventHandler` via `//gojvm:annotation`)
* `command.go`  – the `/hello` command
* `resources/plugin.yml` – plugin metadata (bundled into the jar)
